WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.550
Ask the AI

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.740
Got a specific idea for this game?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:12.250
Write it the way you’d say it: Jacob catches the first two innings, and Noah pitches the last one.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.870
Generate.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:20.370
The AI sets the options, the app generates the lineup and checks the rules.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:26.400
Jacob is catching, Noah pitches the sixth. And you have the final say.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.810
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
